:: Deadwood Smuggler Pub Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-smuggler-pub-environment'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The rock ceiling holds the noise close: scraping chairs, clinking glasses, a laugh from behind a wooden partition. Lanterns hang from stout posts rather than the stone. The bar stands on a raised platform at the back, with bottles tucked between its shelves. Cups, folded papers and a cloth-covered case occupy the tables nearer the entrance.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      岩顶把声音拢在近处：拖动椅子的响动、碰杯声，还有木隔墙后传来的一声笑。灯笼吊在粗木柱上，没有钉进岩石。后方抬高的平台上是吧台，几排酒瓶塞在架间；靠入口的桌上放着杯子、折好的纸，还有一只盖着布的箱子。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if Weather.isSnow>>
        Wet bootprints cross the first few boards. Someone has left a damp coat near the entrance, well away from the lamps.
      <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
        Water runs from a customer's sleeve into a saucer. The bartender slides a rag across the counter without looking up.
      <<elseif Time.dayState is 'night'>>
        A louder table has claimed the middle platform. At the edges, people lean closer to speak, leaving their drinks untouched for a while.
      <<else>>
        An empty barrel rolls slowly along the boards until a worker stops it with a foot. The bartender is turning yesterday's glasses mouth-down on a towel.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if Weather.isSnow>>
        湿靴印越过入口的几块木板。有人把潮湿的外套留在那里，离灯笼远远的。
      <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
        一位客人袖口的水滴进了碟子。酒保没有抬头，只把一块擦布推过柜面。
      <<elseif Time.dayState is 'night'>>
        中间的平台被一桌喧闹的客人占了。坐在边缘的人凑得更近，说话时连杯子都暂且搁着。
      <<else>>
        一只空酒桶顺着木板缓缓滚动，被干活的人用脚挡住。酒保正把洗好的杯子倒扣在毛巾上。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-smuggler-pub-menu'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('StreetLife')?.smugglerPub.available>>
    <<icon 'smuggler.png'>><<lanLink ['Spend some time in the pub', '在酒馆里待一会儿'] 'Deadwood Smuggler Pub'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-smuggler-pub-talk'>>
  <<switch _args[0]>>
    <<case 'bar'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Mind the step." The bartender catches your eye as a tray passes behind you. "Nobody agrees on where that platform ought to end." A thumb indicates a newer length of timber beneath the old boards. "We patch it. They wear it out. Saves us arguing about who built it." Someone calls for another round, and the bartender reaches for a glass.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “留神台阶。”一只托盘从你身后经过时，酒保看了你一眼。“没人能说清这平台到底该修到哪里。”酒保指了指旧木板下面一截新木料。“我们补，他们磨。倒也省得争是谁搭的。”有人喊着再来一轮，酒保便伸手拿杯子去了。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'work'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Four pounds for clearing the tables. Fifteen minutes, if you keep moving." The bartender sets a cloth beside an empty tray. "Glasses back here. Papers stay where their owners left them. One shift a day; I've got someone else for the rest." The offer leaves you free to say no.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “收桌四镑。手脚勤快些，十五分钟。”酒保把一块擦布放到空托盘旁。“杯子拿回这里，纸留在主人放下的位置。一天只缺这么一趟，其余活有人接了。”你可以接下，也可以不管。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'customers'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The bartender follows your glance towards the partitions. "Some come to drink. Some come to talk. Plenty do both." A glass is held against the lantern to check for a crack. "An empty seat doesn't mean an invitation. Ask before taking it." Nobody offers to explain every unfamiliar face in the room.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          酒保顺着你的目光看向隔墙。“有人来喝酒，有人来谈事，不少人两样都做。”一只杯子被举到灯旁，检查有没有裂口。“有空椅子，不等于邀请你坐。先问一声。”没人打算把这里每张陌生面孔都介绍给你。
      <</language>>
  <</switch>><br><br>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Smuggler Pub
<<set _pub to maplebirch.get('StreetLife')?.smugglerPub>>
<<if $location isnot 'underground' or $smuggler_pub_known isnot 1>>
  <<deadwood-street-heist-meeting-required>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<unset $bus>><<effects>>
<<if !_pub?.available>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot linger over the ordinary pub business just now.' '你眼下无法留下来处理酒馆里的小事。'>><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the pub', '返回酒馆'] 'Smuggler Pub'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-smuggler-pub-environment>>

<<if _pub.state.last and Time.date.timeStamp - _pub.state.last.at lte 3600>>
  <<if _pub.state.last.outcome is 'interrupted'>>
    <span class='blue'><<lanSwitch 'You had to stop before finishing.' '你没能做完刚才的事。'>><<if _pub.state.last.action is 'tea'>> <<lanSwitch 'The tea was paid for when you ordered it.' '点好的茶已经付过钱。'>><</if>></span><br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<switch _pub.state.last.action>>
      <<case 'tea'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            The mug is thick enough to warm both hands. The tea has been steeped rather strongly, but the bartender brings the sugar over when you ask. You finish it slowly while someone clears a space for the next tray. <span class='green'>You feel a little less tense.</span>
          <<option 'CN'>>
            杯子很厚，捧着正好暖手。茶泡得有些浓，你开口要糖，酒保便把糖罐拿了过来。你慢慢喝完，旁边有人给下一只托盘腾出位置。<span class='green'>你稍微放松了一些。</span>
        <</language>><br><br>
      <<case 'rest'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You find a bench against one of the wooden walls. The seat is worn smooth; a folded coat keeps you away from a damp patch of stone. Nobody mistakes your silence for an invitation to talk. After a quarter of an hour, you rise and stretch your legs. <span class='green'>The pause has helped.</span>
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你在木隔墙边找到一条长凳。凳面坐得光滑，叠好的外套把你与潮湿的岩壁隔开。没人把你的沉默当成搭话的邀请。一刻钟后，你起身伸了伸腿。<span class='green'>这会儿歇脚让你好受了些。</span>
        <</language>><br><br>
      <<case 'board'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            The pinned scraps concern the pub itself: a board that needs replacing, a missing tray, a request to return borrowed mugs. An old barrel-moving notice has been crossed out. Today's small job is still written clearly: <span class='gold'>clearing the tables, £4</span>. The bartender can offer you one shift, if you have not already taken it.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            钉着的纸条写的都是酒馆自己的事：一块待换的木板、一只不见的托盘，还有请人把借走的杯子送回来。旧的搬桶告示已经划掉。今天的小活仍写得清楚：<span class='gold'>收桌，四镑</span>。如果你还没接过，酒保可以让你干一趟。
        <</language>><br><br>
      <<case 'listen'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You stay at your own table and let the talk drift over.
            <<if maplebirch.get('StreetLife').heist.state.stage is 'prep'>>
              Someone complains about an errand in town; someone else says the figure is wrong. Both speak as though they were there. The folded papers behind the next partition remind you how much still needs checking. A loud story is not a reliable account.
            <<elseif maplebirch.get('StreetLife').reputation gte 50>>
              You hear a familiar delivery mentioned, and then a different name attached to it. A customer notices you listening and drops the subject. The next round brings an argument about whose turn it is to pay.
            <<else>>
              Most of it is ordinary complaining: a late delivery, a lost game, a coat that never dried properly. One customer tries to turn a spilled drink into an impressive story. The others have heard it before.
            <</if>>
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你留在自己的桌边，听着零散的话声飘过来。
            <<if maplebirch.get('StreetLife').heist.state.stage is 'prep'>>
              有人抱怨城里的一趟差事，另一个人却说数字不对。两人都说得像是亲眼所见。隔墙后那些折好的纸，让你想起还有多少事需要核对。说得响，不等于说得准。
            <<elseif maplebirch.get('StreetLife').reputation gte 50>>
              一桩熟悉的送货差事被提了起来，接着却安上了另一个名字。有人发现你在听，便把话题岔开。下一轮酒送来时，他们又开始争该轮到谁付钱。
            <<else>>
              大多只是日常抱怨：送迟的货、输掉的牌局，还有总也晾不干的外套。一位客人试图把打翻酒杯的事讲得惊心动魄，其余人已经听过了。
            <</if>>
        <</language>><br><br>
      <<case 'work'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You collect the empty glasses, wipe the sticky rings from the tables and leave every folded note where it was. A customer lifts a drink out of your way; another forgets until you ask. At the counter, the bartender checks the tray and counts <span class='gold'>£4</span> into your hand. "That'll do for today."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你收起空杯，擦掉桌上黏手的杯印，把每张折好的纸留在原处。有客人主动把酒拿开，也有人等你开口才腾地方。到了柜台，酒保检查过托盘，把<span class='gold'>四镑</span>数到你手里。“今天就这些了。”
        <</language>><br><br>
    <</switch>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>

<<set _pubOfferedAt to Time.date.timeStamp>>
<<for _pubOffer range [
  {id:'tea', name:['Buy a mug of tea', '买一杯热茶'], icon:'orchard/tea-tray.png'},
  {id:'rest', name:['Rest on the bench', '在长凳上歇脚'], icon:'actions/relax.png'},
  {id:'board', name:['Read the pinned notices', '查看钉着的告示'], icon:'street/case-board.png'},
  {id:'listen', name:['Listen to the room', '听听周围的闲谈'], icon:'socialise.png'},
  {id:'work', name:['Help clear the tables', '帮忙收拾桌子'], icon:'sponge.png'}
]>>
  <<set _pubTerm to _pub.actions[_pubOffer.id]>>
  <<capture _pub _pubOffer _pubOfferedAt>>
    <<icon _pubOffer.icon>>
    <<if _pub.can(_pubOffer.id)>>
      <<lanLink _pubOffer.name 'Deadwood Smuggler Pub'>><<run _pub.act(_pubOffer.id, _pubOfferedAt)>><</lanLink>>
    <<else>>
      <span class='grey'><<= lanSwitch(_pubOffer.name[0], _pubOffer.name[1])>></span>
    <</if>>
    (0:<<= String(_pubTerm.minutes).padStart(2, '0')>>)
    <<if _pubTerm.cost gt 0>> · <<printmoney _pubTerm.cost>><</if>>
    <<if _pubOffer.id is 'work'>> · <<lanSwitch 'Pays ' '工钱 '>><<printmoney 400>><</if>>
    <<if _pubOffer.id is 'tea'>> · <<lanSwitch 'up to three mugs a day' '每天至多三杯'>>
    <<elseif _pubOffer.id is 'rest'>> · <<lanSwitch 'once an hour' '每小时一次'>>
    <<elseif ['listen', 'work'].includes(_pubOffer.id)>> · <<lanSwitch 'once a day' '每天一次'>><</if>><br>
  <</capture>>
<</for>><br>
<<if $worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
  <span class='blue'><<lanSwitch 'You cannot drink tea or speak to the bartender while gagged.' '口塞妨碍了喝茶和与酒保交谈。'>></span><br>
<</if>>
<<if $tiredness gte 1800>>
  <span class='blue'><<lanSwitch 'You are too tired to take the table-clearing shift.' '你太累了，暂时无法接下收桌的活。'>></span><br>
<</if>><br>

<div id='deadwood-smuggler-pub-talk'></div>
<<if !$worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
  <<for _pubTopic range [
    {id:'bar', name:['Ask about the wooden platforms', '问问这里的木平台']},
    {id:'work', name:['Ask what work needs doing', '问问有什么小活']},
    {id:'customers', name:['Ask about the regulars', '问问常来的客人']}
  ]>>
    <<capture _pubTopic>>
      <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink _pubTopic.name>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('StreetLife')?.smugglerPub.available and !$worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
          <<replace '#deadwood-smuggler-pub-talk'>><<deadwood-smuggler-pub-talk _pubTopic.id>><</replace>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</capture>>
  <</for>>
<</if>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the pub', '返回酒馆'] 'Smuggler Pub'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
